{"arguments":{"end_line":180,"path":"openspec/changes/archive/2026-02-25-finalize-runtime-driver-contract-architecture/tasks.md","start_line":1},"at":"2026-11-05T14:50:04.119085+00:00","call_id":"call_lZFpTS4pE9be0lE83Q8cUNMl","event":"function_result","name":"read_file","result":{"anchor_sha":"6589365573795fdc67fb24a19b101b0cb65df721","content":"1: ## 1. 分层模型与命名冻结\n2: \n3: - [x] 1.1 在 runtime 模块定义 `AgentDriver` 接口与命名规范（禁止 `AgentProvider`）\n4: - [x] 1.2 定义 `AgentRuntime` 为 contract-neutral 接口并移除 contract 协议类型依赖\n5: - [x] 1.3 定义 `ContractAdapterV1` 作为唯一对外契约出口\n6: \n7: ## 2. Pi 路径分层重构\n8: \n9: - [x] 2.1 新建 `PiDriver` 并下沉所有 Pi SDK 直调逻辑\n10: - [x] 2.2 将 `PiRuntime` 重构为仅依赖 Driver 的执行内核\n11: - [x] 2.3 将现有契约适配逻辑收敛到 `ContractAdapterV1`（命名与职责统一）\n12: \n13: ## 3. 错误与事件链路结构化\n14: \n15: - [x] 3.1 定义 `DriverError` 与 `RuntimeError` 结构并建立映射\n16: - [x] 3.2 移除基于 message 文案关键字的错误码推断路径\n17: - [x] 3.3 定义 `DriverRawEvent -> RuntimeEvent -> ContractEvent` 标准转换链路\n18: \n19: ## 4. 依赖约束与验证\n20: \n21: - [x] 4.1 增加分层依赖约束检查（禁止 runtime/driver 依赖 contract 协议类型）\n22: - [x] 4.2 验证 Electron 命令与事件路径保持 Contract v1 语义一致\n23: - [x] 4.3 设计 Driver conformance 用例，确保后续新增 SDK 仅新增 Driver\n24: \n25: ## 5. 文档与验收\n26: \n27: - [x] 5.1 更新架构文档中的最终分层图与职责定义\n28: - [x] 5.2 完成手工验收：会话生命周期、模型切换、错误码稳定性、事件稳定性\n29: - [x] 5.3 评审并冻结该方案为后续多 SDK 接入基线","content_truncated":false,"path":"openspec/changes/archive/2026-02-25-finalize-runtime-driver-contract-architecture/tasks.md","repository":"unfallenwill/openstitch","returned_lines":[1,29],"sha256":"5dfb11e3b1d2ede07c6ae6a4c98c4be647ecc5de00d5b47a5a850a1f6ecf40d9","status":"found","total_lines":29},"round":4}
{"arguments":{"end_line":160,"path":"openspec/changes/archive/2026-02-25-simplify-runtime-architecture/tasks.md","start_line":1},"at":"2026-11-05T14:50:04.162625+00:00","call_id":"call_paAe6BDcFde46Tp8n0PmiF1J","event":"function_result","name":"read_file","result":{"anchor_sha":"6589365573795fdc67fb24a19b101b0cb65df721","content":"1: ## 1. 创建 AgentRuntime 接口\n2: \n3: - [x] 1.1 在 `shared/contract/v1/` 创建 `agent-runtime.ts`，合并 `AgentRuntime` 和 `RuntimeAdapter` 接口\n4: - [x] 1.2 定义接口方法签名，返回 `ContractResult<T>`\n5: - [x] 1.3 从 `shared/contract/v1/commands.ts` 导入 Input/Output 类型\n6: - [x] 1.4 导出 `AgentRuntime` 接口\n7: \n8: ## 2. 移动 electron-ipc.ts\n9: \n10: - [x] 2.1 创建 `src/main/electron/` 目录\n11: - [x] 2.2 移动 `shared/contract/v1/electron-ipc.ts` 到 `src/main/electron/electron-ipc.ts`\n12: - [x] 2.3 更新 `src/preload/index.ts` 中的导入路径\n13: - [x] 2.4 更新 `src/main/index.ts` 中的导入路径\n14: \n15: ## 3. 重构 PiRuntime 为 DefaultAgentRuntime\n16: \n17: - [x] 3.1 重命名 `pi-runtime.ts` 为 `default-agent-runtime.ts`\n18: - [x] 3.2 类名 `PiRuntime` 改为 `DefaultAgentRuntime`\n19: - [x] 3.3 实现 `shared/contract/v1/agent-runtime.ts` 接口\n20: - [x] 3.4 修改方法返回类型为 `ContractResult<T>`\n21: - [x] 3.5 内部实现 `RuntimeEvent` → `ContractEvent` 转换（原 ContractAdapterV1 逻辑）\n22: - [x] 3.6 添加 seq 序号追踪（原 ContractAdapterV1 逻辑）\n23: - [x] 3.7 错误处理：捕获异常转换为 `ContractResult.fail()`\n24: \n25: ## 4. 更新 main/index.ts\n26: \n27: - [x] 4.1 更新导入：使用 `DefaultAgentRuntime`\n28: - [x] 4.2 删除 `ContractAdapterV1` 相关代码\n29: - [x] 4.3 直接使用 `DefaultAgentRuntime` 实例\n30: - [x] 4.4 更新事件订阅逻辑（直接订阅 `ContractEvent`）\n31: \n32: ## 5. 清理废弃代码\n33: \n34: - [x] 5.1 删除 `src/main/runtime/contract/` 目录\n35: - [x] 5.2 删除 `src/main/runtime/conformance/` 目录\n36: - [x] 5.3 删除 `src/main/runtime/core/agent-runtime.ts`\n37: - [x] 5.4 删除 `src/shared/contract/v1/runtime-adapter.ts`\n38: \n39: ## 6. 添加 FUTURE 注释\n40: \n41: - [x] 6.1 在 `src/main/runtime/plugins/` 目录添加 README 或注释，标明 \"FUTURE: Plugin system for extending AgentRuntime, not yet integrated\"\n42: \n4